{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/997360-gender-fluidi","id":997360,"title":"Gender-fluidi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-02T14:15:16-07:00","id":997360,"title":"Gender-fluidi","content":"My intersex New World Order Operative has decided to be gender-fluid. They have <a href=\"https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/klinefelter-syndrome#diagnosis\" target=\"_blank\">Klinefelter's Syndrome</a> -- refused supplemental testosterone, is trying to reverse decades of osteoporosis-induced bone fragility and identify as bi-gendered. Aside from cross dressing and using breast prosthetics at work on days when they're female-identified and wearing their waist-length hair up when they're not working. Our Amalgam is unlikely to mind. The New World Order and the Union itself also won't care, right? Ambiguous scent and body language aside, I'm not certain how to roleplay them.<br /> <br /> On a different topic, my PC cuts themself with knives or their own sharp nails. It has nothing to did with their gender identity; they're amnesiac due to a botched initial Processing -- among other things that I can't go into for chronicle reasons. The scarring is on either side of their arms and the inside of the thighs. Synthetic Progenitor-grown skin hides most of it. If you reopen old scars, does the hypertrophic scarring get worse?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T16:17:13-07:00","id":997420,"title":"","content":"While the Union's official stance on such things is equality, the reality is not so pleasant. The Union's ranks are just as prone to human prejudice as everyone else, and the Inner Circle is/was made of up of centuries old men that were raised in far less tolerant time. And they tend to promote those that think like them, lending to a long standing amount of bias in the system despite its ideals.<br /> <br /> So on the books, the Union and NWO wouldn't &quot;care&quot; but the individuals that make it up are going to express a wide range of feelings on the subject. It will also probably be mixed, since the NWO esp. would see someone that's gender-fluid and capable of passing well as either as having an excellent skill as a field agent... but that means being whatever gender the NWO needs you to be today, not whatever one you feel like being today (in your concept of someone that switches regularly).<br /> <br /> Also, keep in mind that a gender-fluid person dressing according to the gender presentation they're feeling most like at a given moment isn't &quot;cross-dressing.&quot; Cross dressing is when you dress according to the gender norms of a gender you do not identify as. If a gender fluid individual is feeling male today, and dresses male by their culture, they're not crossing anything in their dress.<br /> <br /> What are you concerned about regarding playing the character?<br /> <br /> As for the scars... there's a lot of variables in that regard.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T18:23:10-07:00","id":997482,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whatever gender is needed today&quot; is fine. ^^ I wasn't sure how to phrase the clothing issue. Thanks. I mostly wasn't sure how the Union would want to use the ability to pass. Would it be realistic if my PC was uncomfortable with having their chest touched, even without prosthetics on? High heels are useless, unless you're attacking someone with them. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T18:55:05-07:00","id":997494,"title":"","content":"It's perfectly ok for a character to be &quot;touchy&quot; with any part of her body, and easy to imagine any non-normative person developing this kind of issue (in a grander level than that of normal people). Some do the contrary, extrapolating sensuality and/or sexuality as a means of self-identity, but it is far from rule. Most are a mix of both stances, so you can play with that as you want to build the character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T19:46:01-07:00","id":997513,"title":"","content":"I think something you need to decide on is if you character experiences significant dysphoria or not; since that's going to play a lot into things like touching.<br /> <br /> As for how the NWO would put this to use:<br /> <br /> Someone that can pass easily as either mainstream genders can be put to a lot of use in terms of intelligence foot work. For example, counter-intelligence people see a man check into a hotel, and are watching for that man to exit and follow, and then ignore a woman that moves through the lobby that might be slightly similar looking. And there's situations where different genders can be used (esp. with Mind procedures) to sway people. A woman being caring and nurturing can play into cultural biases and get more progress in that regard, compared to a man playing into a more domineering role. The cultural biases around gender are strong, and having someone that can play off the best for the situation can be very potent from that perspective.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T20:53:41-07:00","id":997540,"title":"","content":"My PC used to assassinate people for a living and would dress up as the opposite gender to get out of crime scenes. There's no dysphoria, just a tendency to shift genders. Right now, they literally have no memory of any sort of past other than &quot;waking up&quot; with their hands locked around a dying Psych Ops <i>barabbus' </i>throat, who also had multiple lethal injuries.<br /> <br /> It's a bad idea to Process someone who's psychic and can kill bare-handed.<br /> <br /> They do tend twitch abruptly when touched, even in an innocuous manner, and expect to be physically assaulted, but that's partly because someone is taking advantage of their fugue.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the NWO info. ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1973,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","user":"Saint Michael","date":". 11-03-2016, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T22:07:07-07:00","id":997552,"title":"","content":"Gender shifting is a touchy subject. Gender fluidity is more about shifting tertiary sexual characteristics in order to adopt a culturally normative representation of a particular gender. Gender shifting tends to suggest a psychological change, usually in the form of a dissociative disorder or multiple personalities, which would represent deep psychological issues. I have known examples of both, and gender fluid people are a lot safer to be around.<br /> <br /> Klinefelter Syndrome is not really that bad even when untreated, though there are complications that can evolve. The character is obviously off 'his' rocker from your description, so gender shifting would be more thematic than gender fluidity. Plenty of men wear their hair long and plenty of women wear their hair short, so length of hair is not a gendered trait anymore (no more than flannel shirts, blue jeans, or cowboy boots). It is more behavior than dress that will determine gender in most cases of an androgynous individual, and I have seen gender fluid people switch genders in the middle of a conversation when they started to desire the person they were talking to (which is an interesting thing to witness, when a man becomes a woman, and you suddenly find that your feelings change with their gender).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T05:04:51-07:00","id":997635,"title":"","content":"Interestingly enough, M20 mentions that of all Mage the groups out there as a whole, the *Progenitors* are surprisingly enough the most comfortable and openminded when it comes to anything gender fluidity, gender changing and things in between. So if anything, there is at least a group in the Technocracy that can support, advise and Make Things Happen without many questions asked.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T06:33:25-07:00","id":997661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/997360-gender-fluidi?p=997635#post997635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interestingly enough, M20 mentions that of all Mage the groups out there as a whole, the *Progenitors* are surprisingly enough the most comfortable and openminded when it comes to anything gender fluidity, gender changing and things in between. So if anything, there is at least a group in the Technocracy that can support, advise and Make Things Happen without many questions asked.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, the progenitors would be all over that stuff. Some might even consider being &quot;extragender&quot; as the next phase in human evolution. It's no mistake that their Revised Con book has a picture of a human with a masculine torso and a feminine face. Depending on who you ask they might even provide your character with Adaptive Prosthetics designed to alter the shape of the body at the flick of a switch (or the flick of a thought). Expensive and prone to Rejection, sure. But not at all impossible.<br /> <br /> Arguably, members of Iteration X could also be seen as able to accept, or at least ignore, the differences of gender. This would fit into to their ethic of Transhumanism in general, and the idea that Gender, especially Sex, are completely unnecessary constructs in the transhumanist world, so any example of such being deconstructed would work to further their claim that such things are unnecessary.<br /> <br /> Void Engineers would depend on who's in charge. But I think they'd be more wary of the fact that you're NWO than anything else. These guys really don't like NWO.<br /> <br /> Syndicate are likely to be the most close minded when it comes to gender fluidity. The only exception being pandering to the niche market. Gay Pride events can be a real sale boost for things like rainbow flags, feather boas, and all kinds of clothing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T06:36:21-07:00","id":997662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/997360-gender-fluidi?p=997635#post997635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interestingly enough, M20 mentions that of all Mage the groups out there as a whole, the *Progenitors* are surprisingly enough the most comfortable and openminded when it comes to anything gender fluidity, gender changing and things in between. So if anything, there is at least a group in the Technocracy that can support, advise and Make Things Happen without many questions asked.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would this be surprising? The progenitors intend to be masters of the biological process and I can imagine them making or providing injections so biological sex could match social gender perceptions as desired.<br /> <br /> Or the occasional progenitor with a focus on healing, and matching the body to the mind would be a treatment of mental ailments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2818-frostfox","name":"FrostFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T06:45:34-07:00","id":997665,"title":"","content":"As a genderfluid person, I just want to add that switching back and forth between two distinct genders is more what I would describe as bigender. Genderfluidity, at least for me, is more, well, fluid. Different mixes of masculinity and femininity at different times, as opposed to being male at times and female at others. I wouldn't correct a real person who identified as genderfluid and tell them they sounded bigender, but since this is a fictional character, it might be worth considering if you are using the most accurate description of their gender(s).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T06:56:38-07:00","id":997668,"title":"","content":"See, I'm imagining a very mixed bag.<br /> The technocracy want to 'normalise' everything. Deviancy encourage marginalization, and marginalization encourages joining radical fringe groups and whatnot. Or so the ruling council might fear.<br /> But, at the same time, everything getting too normal is what's preventing the advancement of the consensus, and why we aren't driving hover cars and all have robotic butlers and no health issues. And of course, new bright minds join the technocracy every year with their own vision of saving the masses. <br /> <br /> I don't think the technocracy are going to lock them up and dissect them (they've probably already done that by now) but I do think they'll have vested interests in the following:<br /> <br /> <br /> Correcting gender dysphoria with EITHER mind magic or life magic, as controversial as that might be. This is especially important in agents, but plans to work this on the general public will have been in motion for some time now.<br /> <br /> Better gender changes than the current hack'n slash surgery we have today. Like a penis pill that gives you a penis, or maybe an injected serum rather than implants for larger breasts. Hormonal therapy is an excellent start in the sleeper world. But anything more advanced... maybe it might come with some paradox, particularly if new parts are working.<br /> <br /> <br /> But, also remember that this is world of darkness, and you're in the tradition that's epitomizes stasis, and even though they advance science and technology, they've been quite conservative with culture. Old traditions die hard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":12414,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","user":"Flower,Innocent","date":". 11-03-2016, 10:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","name":"Flower,Innocent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T07:53:25-07:00","id":997692,"title":"","content":"I think different conventions would have different degrees of acceptance and even different agents within conventions even. The Technocracy may put forth the appearance of homogeneousness but the point of being a mage, even a technocratic mage, is their willpower and their own impressions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2818-frostfox","name":"FrostFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T08:08:53-07:00","id":997702,"title":"","content":"As a side note, I'd recommend checking with your ST and fellow players if this is somewhere that they're ok with the game going, as it seems that you've chosen a lot of really unique details to build a character upon. Unless these things are both just small details about your character that add flavor, not overplayed defining characteristics, as well being within the realm of comfort for all other players involved, you're probably going to come across as a &quot;that guy.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6384-frozenfishy","name":"Frozenfishy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T09:22:29-07:00","id":997739,"title":"","content":"I'm the ST, so that's not a problem. ^^ I asked everyone playing if they have things they want to avoid. Gender-bending wasn't one of them. Mostly, it's just flavor. We already have trans*, intersex, lesbian, homosexual, pansexual, bisexual, and literal gender-shifting PCs. A bi-gendered individual won't matter.<br /> <br /> Thank you for the feedback.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T14:46:53-07:00","id":997893,"title":"","content":"I think the year you play might be important. Like a chronicle set in the 70's, 80's or 90's is going to be more restrictive as the older power is less exposed to the stuff. However, the technocracy has always been years ahead of everyone else, maybe they've got a bit ahead of everyone on this issue. 2010 has been quite good to the trans community and I think we're looking up. 2020/30 is probably going to have it totaly fine.<br /> <br /> I think, there are still going to be regressive people in the technocracy though. Maybe all that proccessing isn't too good either.<br /> One thing that might be interesting as a story hook could be the use of life or mind to 'fix' the problem. Some people might think the best way to cure someone of non-traditional gender identity/orientation/hobbies is to use the mind sphere.<br /> Others, would want to manipulate the body to conform to what we wish of ourselves. I feel as if the Egg heads of the technocracy would be fine with implants, but would be incredibly eager to do MORE. If they can't rewrite your DNA, or have your whole body morph effortlessly to what it'd be like on your other side, then they'll feel like they've not done their jobs. If you can't change faster and more cleanly than a tzmisce with ten dots of celerity, and have all the new parts work, then there's more work to be done. <br /> <br /> <br /> Iteration X= Fuck gender, become machines. (yep, i get that they're moving away from that)<br /> Progenitors= Life and physical remodeling is always the answer!<br /> New world order= Either &quot;LGBT is a counterculture. We can't have that&quot; or &quot;<i>SCIENCE</i>! it boys, it makes us look good. and we can't have those pesky traditions folks appeal more to this community. This is an issue folk would be extremely grateful that we solved by giving them the bodies that we want&quot;<br /> Syndicate= Whatever makes the most money. Probably the life stuff.<br /> Void engineers=","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","name":"Flower,Innocent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T17:26:01-07:00","id":997971,"title":"","content":"Void Engineers= Yeah yeah, gender and all that. Can they pilot a ship?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T18:17:09-07:00","id":997994,"title":"","content":"Going to work with what Flower Innocent brought up with the different Conventions might think both good and bad. After that is part of a Technocracy game is Dark parts of it that want to play Big Brother and make sure you do things their way.<br /> <br /> NWO<br /> The Good- You would make a great Grey Suit<br /> The Bad- That member the Ivory Tower just might want to cure you.<br /> The Ugly- Room 101<br /> <br /> Iteration x<br /> The Good- You are on a path to Transhumanity<br /> The Bad- This come from my experience with ItX and the Computer making them think in 1 and 0 and you HAVE be one of the other.<br /> The Bad- They can rebuild you they have the Technology<br /> <br /> Progenitors<br /> The Good- Well since they are Masters of Life they can make different clones, help you change genders how ever you want.<br /> The Bad- They want to turn you into a specimen. <br /> The Ugly- The bad is pretty ugly so no need to make it worse<br /> <br /> Syndicate<br /> The Good- Money<br /> The Bad- MONEY<br /> The Ugly- No Money<br /> <br /> Void Engineers<br /> The Good- You are NWO so if you are useful awesome if not just stay out of the way. VE just really care if you can do your job or help out. Kind of works that way in the Deep Umbra<br /> The Bad- Your NWO is enough<br /> The Ugly- accidents happen.<br /> <br /> Now of course this all depends on how far you want to take the dark part of the World of Darkness. While I would keep it on The Good side the threat of the bad is part of what the Technocracy is about plus it could lead to a good session or two. Heck The Bad or The Ugly could be Nephandi or Wurm tainted just depends on what system you use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9486-jbrocky","name":"JBRocky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9486_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T23:07:06-07:00","id":998103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JBRocky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/997360-gender-fluidi?p=997994#post997994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Syndicate<br /> The Good- Money<br /> The Bad- MONEY<br /> The Ugly- No Money</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe I found this too funny. <br /> <br /> But honestly am i the only one that that thinks your idea of changing genders is too tame for mages? Crossdressing with easily implemented breast implants? Do you want to insult the progenitors? <br /> If we haven't remodeled your entirity then we haven't done enough. There's so many ways to do it, drugs, injections lasers, gas, genetic changes, putting your mind into a clone with the body you want, those masks you see in spy movies that are really just another person's face (only with the body and stuff) Nanomachines, surgeon bots, turning your body into some kind of mr-potato head figure. Some kind of Tzmisce-I-Fleshcraft myself stuff. making your flesh malleable. Putting your brain into a jar and then screwing that jar into a HIT mark who has the gender you want to be for the day. <br /> <br /> Mind would work for an obfuscate-like effect, right? Now do we do that with radiation waves or pheremones... <br /> <br /> I would get excited just thinking about a... willing subject. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","name":"Flower,Innocent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T11:57:32-07:00","id":998355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flower,Innocent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/997360-gender-fluidi?p=998103#post998103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe I found this too funny.<br /> <br /> But honestly am i the only one that that thinks your idea of changing genders is too tame for mages? Crossdressing with easily implemented breast implants? Do you want to insult the progenitors?<br /> If we haven't remodeled your entirity then we haven't done enough. There's so many ways to do it, drugs, injections lasers, gas, genetic changes, putting your mind into a clone with the body you want, those masks you see in spy movies that are really just another person's face (only with the body and stuff) Nanomachines, surgeon bots, turning your body into some kind of mr-potato head figure. Some kind of Tzmisce-I-Fleshcraft myself stuff. making your flesh malleable. Putting your brain into a jar and then screwing that jar into a HIT mark who has the gender you want to be for the day.<br /> <br /> Mind would work for an obfuscate-like effect, right? Now do we do that with radiation waves or pheremones...<br /> <br /> I would get excited just thinking about a... willing subject.</div> </div> </div> </div> Glad you liked the Syndicate part I tried to put some humor into my post since we are here to have fun and enjoy ourselves. I do totally agree with you on the Progenitors, lots of good stuff they can do with a willing subject, just need to worry when they have an unwilling one. But hey there is a reason my favorite splat book is the Progenitor one since it made the Technocracy much more than just MiB and Hit Marks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9486-jbrocky","name":"JBRocky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9486_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T14:25:55-08:00","id":999947,"title":"","content":"My character's leery of the concept of Enhancement. They're also immune to morphine and most hypermeds. Last time they permanently lost some sweat glands and all of their prints. Medicalization of the body -- being poked and prodded, DEXA scans, CT scans, MRIs, x-rays, experimental Procedures -- is also an issue. When you pretty much live in the hospital, you want to avoid it whenever you can. <br /> <br /> The idea of Paradox turning them into a biological woman is amusing though. Maybe the next time the Marauder suffers Backlash. XD<br /> <br /> So, if I'm playing a gender-fluid person, they would shift body language depending on which gender they're talking to, right? Or just shift from one to the other if it's a mixed group. I can see them wearing lingerie underneath a black suit, or stockings beneath jeans. I'll go do more research. ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}